        "original_id": "f18c7fde-67ce-5966-9875-e9bb3009258a",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Boston Celtics, Los Angeles Lakers, NBA, Forbes\n- Events: 2008 NBA Playoffs, NBA Finals\n- Topics: franchise valuation\n\nFacts:\n- The 2008 NBA Playoffs concluded with the Eastern Conference champion Boston Celtics defeating the Western Conference champion Los Angeles Lakers 4 games to 2 in the NBA Finals.\n- As of 2017, Forbes ranked the Los Angeles Lakers as the second most valuable franchise in the NBA and estimated the franchise's value at $3.0 billion.",
